OL,3,GNEWSAExtinct tiger head sells for
OL,4,A'ground-breaking' sum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of an extinct tiger that was
OL,7,Fkept under a bed for years has "made
OL,8,Fhistory" after selling for #170,000 at
OL,9,Fauction.
OL,11,FDescribed as the "most important
OL,12,Fobject" ever to be sold at an auction
OL,13,Fhouse, the mounted head of the
OL,14,Fthylacine, or Tasmanian tiger, was dug
OL,15,Fout from storage when its owner
OL,16,Frealised its rarity after seeing a
OL,17,Fsimilar specimen make the news in
OL,18,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
