OL,3,GNEWSAExtinct tiger head sells for
OL,4,A'ground-breaking' sum
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicknamed Trevor, the specimen is "one
OL,7,Fof only three known to exist in the
OL,8,Fworld" and was expected to fetch
OL,9,Fbetween #30,000 and #50,000 at auction
OL,10,Fin Bath.
OL,12,F"This is a truly ground-breaking
OL,13,Fresult," said auctioneer Andrew Stowe,
OL,14,Ffrom Auctioneum. "This isn't just about
OL,15,Fthe auction result - we have made
OL,16,Fhistory."
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
